OL,3,GNEWSAGive your views on new hospital as
OL,4,Aplans go on show
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Cambridgeshire are being
OL,7,Finvited to view the latest plans for a
OL,8,Fnew hospital, including a scale model
OL,9,Fof the proposed building.
OL,11,FHinchingbrooke Hospital in Huntingdon
OL,12,Fwas one of four in the East of England
OL,13,Fwith Raac (reinforced autoclaved
OL,14,Faerated concrete) in some of its walls
OL,15,Fand roof, causing ongoing structural
OL,16,Fissues.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
