OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGive your views on new hospital as
OL,4,Aplans go on show
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth West Anglia NHS Foundation Trust,
OL,7,Fwhich runs the hospital, said the
OL,8,Flatest designs and proposals would be
OL,9,Fon display at an event on Saturday,
OL,10,Fwhere people can provide feedback and
OL,11,Fmeet members of the project team.
OL,13,FThe free event will be held in the
OL,14,Fhospital's Garden Restaurant between
OL,15,F10:00 BST and 14:00.
